---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Standards | ARCBRIM BUILDERS" current="standards">
  <section class="section">
    <h1>Standards</h1>
    <p class="muted">Arcbrim Builders operates against explicit standards. These standards exist to protect outcomes, reduce ambiguity, and establish accountability. They are enforced consistently.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>Standards Are Enforced</h2>
    <p>Standards exist to protect outcomes, reduce ambiguity, and establish accountability. They are enforced consistently.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>Communication Standards</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Decisions are documented</li>
      <li>Communication follows an agreed cadence</li>
      <li>Breakdowns in clarity are escalated early</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Informal direction is not acted upon.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>Change Management</h2>
    <p>Changes are evaluated before execution.</p>
    <p>Any change includes:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Scope impact</li>
      <li>Cost impact</li>
      <li>Schedule impact</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Changes outside this process are not honored.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>Accountability</h2>
    <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap:16px;">
      <div class="callout">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">Our Accountability</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Execution within defined scope</li>
          <li>Transparent communication</li>
          <li>Controlled delivery</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="callout">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">Client Accountability</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Timely decisions</li>
          <li>Access and approvals</li>
          <li>Respect for agreed process</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p style="margin-top:14px;">Balance is essential.</p>

    <div class="actions">
      <a class="button" href="/inquiry">Begin an inquiry</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
